Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"> In 2023, the Group also borrowed interest free loans of RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymt:BorrowedInterestFreeLoans" contextRef="cref_957693909" unitRef="uref_1062913725" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-32012">6,874</ix:nonFraction> from an entities controlled by a preferred shareholder. The Group repaid RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymt:BorrowedInterestFreeLoans" contextRef="cref_776522736" unitRef="uref_1062913725" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-32013">6,874</ix:nonFraction> in 2024. </p><p style="font: 7pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p><ix:nonNumeric name="ymt:ScheduleOfOtherShareholderLoanActivitiesTableTextBlock" contextRef="cref_815770424" escape="true" id="ixv-24164"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Other Shareholder Loans activities for the&#160;years ended December&#160;31, 2024 and 2025 are presented below:</p><p style="font: 7pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"> <tbody><tr style="vertical-align: bottom"><td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td> <td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td> <td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid">RMB</td> <td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td> <td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td> <td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid">USD</td> <td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td> </tr><tr style="vertical-align: bottom"><td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td> <td